# The Accounting Encoder proposes a change to ${DOC}, section ${SECTION},
# from the document itself, and runs the check.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | ACC_Juan
type #login-password | Office123!
click button[type=submit] |
wait My Manuals
click .nav-item | My Manuals
wait ${DOC}
click .card | ${DOC}
wait Table of Contents
click .toc-item | ${SECTION}
wait Propose changes
click button | Propose changes
wait Why this change is being made
fill #overall-reason | ${REASON}
click .proposal-section-head | ${SECTION}
wait Save this section
fill .proposal-section-body textarea | ${TEXT}
click button | Save this section
wait Run the check
click button | Run the check
slowwait checked —
shot ${TAG}drafted
errors
